[
  {
    "title": "Searching & Comparing Algorithms",
    "tag": "LESSON 20",
    "time": "0–2 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P · Searching",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">AP Computer Science Principles</p><h1>Searching &amp;<br>Comparing Algorithms</h1><p class=\"zh\">线性搜索 · 二分搜索 · 比较成本</p><p class=\"small\">90 minutes · Same membership question, different search paths.</p>",
    "note": "本课接在列表、遍历、过程之后，问题统一为“目标是否在列表里”。先确立正确性，再比較元素检查次数。二分搜索只解释与追踪，不要求完整实现；资料中的计数单位为检查一个元素一次，不把一个步骤的多个运算符分别计数。",
    "kind": "dark"
  },
  {
    "title": "Retrieve lists and return values",
    "tag": "RETRIEVAL · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "2–6 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.N/O · AAP-3.A",
    "html": "<ol><li>For [3,8,12], which value is at index 1?</li><li>What does FOR EACH do with the list elements?</li><li>Does RETURN(false) send back a Boolean or display a message?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">3; visits the elements sequentially in list order; sends back a Boolean value.</div></details>",
    "note": "联系L17的一基索引、L18遍历、L19返回值。学生若把索引1解释成第二个元素，应在开始二分追踪前修正。RETURN与DISPLAY不同，本课比较的是搜索结果，不强求所有算法打印相同的追踪过程。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Learning goals",
    "tag": "GOALS",
    "time": "6–8 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.1–3",
    "html": "<ol><li>Trace a linear search to found or not found.</li><li>Explain why binary search needs sorted data.</li><li>Track a shrinking candidate interval.</li><li>Compare checked elements for the same input.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">We trace binary search; a full implementation is not required.</p>",
    "note": "引用CED排除条款：具体binary search实现不在本课程考试范围。本课不用FLOOR或复杂上下界代码，把精力放在为何能删除一半候选及何时不存在候选。"
  },
  {
    "title": "State the search question precisely",
    "tag": "MEMBERSHIP",
    "time": "8–12 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.5 · AAP-2.L",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Sorted list · indices 1–7; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Sorted list · indices 1–7</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>Question: does the target value occur anywhere in this list?</p><p class=\"small\">Answer true when found; answer false only when no candidates remain.</p>",
    "note": "同样列表和目标才是公平比较的前提。此课主例无重复值，避免把“返回首个索引”与“是否存在”混在一起；布尔成员关系是任务，索引是追踪工具。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Linear search checks in order",
    "tag": "LINEAR SEARCH",
    "time": "12–16 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Start: first element → Continue: next unchecked value → Stop: match or end\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Start</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">first element</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Continue</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">next unchecked value</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Stop</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">match or end</text></svg></figure><p>It works with sorted or unsorted lists.</p><p class=\"small\">After a match, an early-stopping linear search need not inspect later elements.</p>",
    "note": "线性搜索逐个检查直到找到或查完，本课默认遇到匹配立即停止。有的FOR EACH成员检查示例会继续遍历，但如果使用那种版本，应显式说明成本不同，不能混用两种数目。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Count element checks, not code lines",
    "tag": "WORKED LINEAR TRACE",
    "time": "16–20 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.5 · AAP-2.O.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Target 34 · check 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, then 34; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50. Highlighted index 6\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Target 34 · check 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, then 34</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>Found after <strong>6 element checks</strong>. The value 50 is not inspected.</p><p class=\"small\">One check means inspecting one list element against the target.</p>",
    "note": "这是示范题，图中明确给出完整追踪。6指访问过的六个元素，不是代码字符数、排序次数或比较表达式内部运算符数。下一题让学生独立处理未找到的情况。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Not found requires exhausting candidates",
    "tag": "ORIGINAL PRACTICE",
    "time": "20–24 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.O.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Linear search for target 28; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Linear search for target 28</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>Predict the result and the number of element checks.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>false, 7 checks.</strong> This linear-search version checks all seven elements because no match appears.</div></details>",
    "note": "28不存在；不要因为接近27就返回找到。题目没有规定排序专用提前停止，所以线性算法不能在34处靠大小关系停下并报6次。对相同列表可能写出不同正确变式，比较前要先定义算法。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Binary search starts in the middle",
    "tag": "BINARY SEARCH",
    "time": "24–28 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.1–2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Target 34 · inspect middle value 19; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50. Highlighted index 4\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Target 34 · inspect middle value 19</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>34 is greater than 19. In ascending order, indices 1–4 cannot contain 34.</p><p class=\"callout\">Keep only indices 5–7 as candidates.</p>",
    "note": "从排序关系证明删除的元素不可能匹配，不靠“计算机知道哪边”叙述。已经检查的中点19也删除，不留在下轮反复比较。排序从小到大是本课统一约定。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Repeat on the remaining interval",
    "tag": "WORKED BINARY TRACE",
    "time": "28–32 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.3 · AAP-4.A.6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Next candidates: 27, 34, 50 · middle 34 matches; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50. Highlighted index 6\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Next candidates: 27, 34, 50 · middle 34 matches</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#d3ad62\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#e2eeeb\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>The search examined <strong>19, then 34</strong>: 2 element checks.</p><p class=\"small\">Both searches return true; the numbers of checks differ.</p>",
    "note": "与第6页同一数据、同一目标对比：linear6，binary2。正确结果一致不代表每次走相同路径。这里只计元素检查，不计准备排序成本；稍后讨论数据本来未排序的情况。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Sorted order makes elimination safe",
    "tag": "WHY SORTING MATTERS",
    "time": "32–36 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.b · P.2",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Known order: left values are smaller → Compare midpoint: target is larger → Safe elimination: discard left + middle\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Known order</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">left values are smaller</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Compare midpoint</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">target is larger</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Safe elimination</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">discard left + middle</text></svg></figure><p>Without order, the discarded half might contain the target.</p><p class=\"small\">Sorting is a prerequisite, not an optional speed improvement.</p>",
    "note": "用五张乱序卡打乱，说明中间值与两侧大小没有可靠关系。二分不是“每次随便砍掉一半”，可删除性依赖已知排序。降序也可配套调整规则，本课模拟器只用升序。"
  },
  {
    "title": "When the target is absent",
    "tag": "PREDICT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "36–40 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Binary search for 28 · record each inspected value; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Binary search for 28 · record each inspected value</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>Write the inspected values and the final result.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\"><strong>19 → 34 → 27; false.</strong> After 27 is ruled out, no candidate remains.</div></details>",
    "note": "第1步保留27/34/50，第2步因为28<34仅留27，第3步27不等于28且没有其余候选，未找到。最后一次无需访问不存在的索引；概念上候选区间为空即终止。"
  },
  {
    "title": "How quickly does the interval shrink?",
    "tag": "INTERVAL HALVING",
    "time": "40–44 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"31 candidates: inspect midpoint → At most 15: then at most 7 → At most 3: then at most 1\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">31 candidates</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">inspect midpoint</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">At most 15</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">then at most 7</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">At most 3</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">then at most 1</text></svg></figure><p>For a sorted list of 31 distinct values, at most five midpoint checks are needed.</p><p class=\"small\">Sequence of candidate sizes before checks: 31, 15, 7, 3, 1.</p>",
    "note": "逐层数5次不是数4个箭头。大小为2的k次幂减1能均分，避免此页中点舍入细节。无需对数公式，最多五次同时覆盖成功和失败；一次恰中中间值只需一次。"
  },
  {
    "title": "A faster method is not faster on every target",
    "tag": "COMPARE CASES",
    "time": "44–48 min",
    "code": "AAP-4.A.5–6",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Predict linear and binary element checks; Target 3: near beginning, Target 19: middle, Target 50: end\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Predict linear and binary element checks</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Target 3</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">near beginning</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Target 19</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">middle</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Target 50</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">end</text></svg></figure><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Target 3: linear 1, binary 3. Target 19: linear 4, binary 1. Target 50: linear 7, binary 3.</div></details>",
    "note": "反对绝对化“binary每次都更快”。这三个具体输入足以说明线性对首元素有最好情况。二分整体在大规模有序数据常更有效，但一个样例不证明所有输入的成本。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Define conventions before comparing",
    "tag": "FAIR COMPARISON",
    "time": "48–52 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.L · AAP-4.A.3/5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Same input: list + target → Same result: membership Boolean → Same measure: element checks\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Same input</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">list + target</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Same result</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">membership Boolean</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Same measure</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">element checks</text></svg></figure><p>For an even-sized interval, our simulator chooses the left of the two middle elements.</p><p class=\"small\">The classroom comparison ignores sorting unless preparation is explicitly included.</p>",
    "note": "偶数区间允许不同中点约定，次数题必须说明，以免学生两个正确追踪结果冲突。根实验室采用左中点，本课主要7元素数据逐轮奇数，避免不必要实现。明确整个任务成本可包含排序，本页只统一搜索比较。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Choose with the data context in mind",
    "tag": "DESIGN DECISION",
    "time": "52–55 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.3 · AAP-4.A",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Unsorted, one query: linear is a simple option → Already sorted: binary can halve → Many future queries: consider preparation cost\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Unsorted, one query</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">linear is a simple option</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Already sorted</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">binary can halve</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Many future queries</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">consider preparation cost</text></svg></figure><p>Sorting a list takes work. Compare the whole task, not only the search phase.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">A one-time search need not sort first. Repeated searches on maintained sorted data can benefit from binary search.</div></details>",
    "note": "不主张任何一次性搜索都必然线性更优，因为输入规模与实现仍影响成本。这里是有根据的设计选择：无需排序就能正确搜索，无需虚构排序复杂度公式。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: write predictions first",
    "tag": "PRACTICAL INVESTIGATION · 55–60",
    "time": "55–60 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P · CRD-2.J",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\"><a href=\"Chapter_4_Algorithms_Lab.html#search\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Open the search simulator ↗</a></p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Use [3,8,12,19,27,34,50]; values 3, 8, 12, 19, 27, 34, 50\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 202\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"32\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"28\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Use [3,8,12,19,27,34,50]</text><rect x=\"40\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"112\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"112\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">1</text><rect x=\"202\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"274\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">8</text><text x=\"274\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">2</text><rect x=\"364\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"436\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">12</text><text x=\"436\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><rect x=\"526\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"598\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"598\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">4</text><rect x=\"688\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"760\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">27</text><text x=\"760\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">5</text><rect x=\"850\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"922\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">34</text><text x=\"922\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">6</text><rect x=\"1012\" y=\"60\" width=\"145\" height=\"85\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1084\" y=\"114\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"1084\" y=\"181\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text></svg></figure><p>Predict both algorithms for target 34, then target 28.</p>",
    "note": "搜索页签是专用可视化模拟器，不让学生粘贴robot或完整伪代码。先设相同列表和目标，写下预期检查序列后单步执行。把“看见输出”转化为有比较意义的证据。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: follow candidates step by step",
    "tag": "PRACTICAL INVESTIGATION · 60–66",
    "time": "60–66 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P.a",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Inspect: one current element → Record: value + decision → Update: remaining candidates\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Inspect</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">one current element</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Record</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">value + decision</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Update</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">remaining candidates</text></svg></figure><p>Run each search one step at a time. Record result, inspected values and check count.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">For 34: linear 6, binary 2. For 28: linear 7, binary 3. The results are true and false respectively.</div></details>",
    "note": "要求学生给出序列而非只抄计数。若差异来自中点选取或者线性提前停止设定，先检查算法约定而非急着判错。实验室中已排序状态和剩余候选应与纸面完全对应。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: test an end and a beginning",
    "tag": "PRACTICAL INVESTIGATION · 66–71",
    "time": "66–71 min",
    "code": "CRD-2.J · AAP-4.A.5",
    "html": "<figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Add successful cases with different positions; 3: first element, 19: initial midpoint, 50: last element\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 193\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><text x=\"600\" y=\"35\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"27\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Add successful cases with different positions</text><rect x=\"50.0\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">3</text><text x=\"225.83333333333334\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">first element</text><rect x=\"416.6666666666667\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">19</text><text x=\"592.5\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">initial midpoint</text><rect x=\"783.3333333333334\" y=\"62\" width=\"351.6666666666667\" height=\"112\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"108\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"35\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">50</text><text x=\"959.1666666666667\" y=\"151\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"25\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">last element</text></svg></figure><p>Compare observed costs and explain one case where linear uses fewer checks.</p><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Linear uses fewer checks for 3: one instead of three. Binary uses one check for 19 and three for 50.</div></details>",
    "note": "不同位置是搜索算法的关键测试维度；只选中点会过分乐观估计binary。要有前端、中间、末端、缺失四种证据，既看成功也看失败。"
  },
  {
    "title": "Lab: challenge the prerequisite",
    "tag": "PRACTICAL INVESTIGATION · 71–76",
