    "code": "AAP-2.P.b",
    "html": "<p>Consider unsorted data [9, 1, 7, 3, 5] and target 9.</p><figure class=\"visual\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Middle value: 7 → Wrong elimination: keep only right side → Lost candidate: 9 was on the left\" viewBox=\"0 0 1200 190\" style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><rect x=\"20.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Middle value</text><text x=\"195.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">7</text><path d=\"M378.0 97H404.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M404.0 91L416.0 97L404.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"425.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Wrong elimination</text><text x=\"600.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">keep only right side</text><path d=\"M783.0 97H809.0\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#225a83\" stroke-width=\"3\"/><path d=\"M809.0 91L821.0 97L809.0 103Z\" fill=\"#225a83\"/><rect x=\"830.0\" y=\"20\" width=\"350.0\" height=\"150\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#fcfcfa\" stroke=\"#28766f\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"69\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"29\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#193148\">Lost candidate</text><text x=\"1005.0\" y=\"122\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"26\" font-weight=\"400\" fill=\"#193148\">9 was on the left</text></svg></figure><p class=\"callout\">Use linear search, or sort before binary search. Do not treat an invalid run as evidence of correctness.</p>",
    "note": "这页给出违反前提的反例，图展示错误算法如何漏9；模拟器若拒绝无序输入，拒绝本身是前提检查，不需要强行运行。学生可先纸面反例，再排序[1,3,5,7,9]验证合法二分。"
  },
