    "time": "83–85 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P · Searching",
    "html": "<p class=\"lead\">12 original questions · 30 classroom marks · about 40 minutes.</p><ol><li>Write the search convention and count inspected elements.</li><li>Explain why a half can safely be removed.</li><li>Compare correctness separately from cost.</li></ol><p class=\"callout\">Next: apply sequence, selection and iteration to a robot.</p>",
    "note": "作业不写完整binarysearch程序、不需FLOOR或Big-O。若学生通过背中点序列回答，换一个目标后要求说出保留侧的大小关系。机器人课继续算法等价与执行成本，但引入朝向状态。"
  },
  {
