    "tag": "EXIT · ORIGINAL",
    "time": "85–90 min",
    "code": "AAP-2.P · Searching",
    "html": "<ol><li>What prerequisite permits binary elimination?</li><li>How many binary checks find 34 in our list?</li><li>Can linear use fewer checks on one input?</li><li>What stops an unsuccessful binary search?</li></ol><details><summary>Show answer</summary><div class=\"answer\">Sorted order; 2; yes, for example target 3; no remaining candidates.</div></details>",
    "note": "建议至少三项正确且第一项能解释排序与删除关系。最后一项答“超过固定次数”不够，要指出候选已全部排除。记录需要回讲的学生，避免将中点算法理解成猜数字游戏。"
